t best teams to win their way to the finals of Masterteam 87."},{"s":3,"e":35,"t":"Episode 35","a":"1987-12-07","l":25,"d":"This is the last week for teams to win medals and go forward to qualify for the final stages and the chance to become Masterteam 87."},{"s":3,"e":36,"t":"Episode 36","a":"1987-12-08","l":25,"d":"The eighth team on the leader board are hoping that they will still be there on Friday, but there is still a chance for one more team to get that all important place in the finals."},{"s":3,"e":37,"t":"Episode 37","a":"1987-12-09","l":25,"d":"During the last seven weeks teams have come from all over Great Britain and Northern Ireland and tonight the teams are from Durham and Essex."},{"s":3,"e":38,"t":"Episode 38","a":"1987-12-10","l":25,"d":"The Halestormers from Hertford are the last new team to compete in this year's series."},{"s":3,"e":39,"t":"Episode 39","a":"1987-12-11","l":25},{"s":3,"e":40,"t":"Episode 40","a":"1987-12-14","l":25,"d":"Having fought off tough competition from over 60 teams, tonight's teams find themselves playing in the second of the quarter-finals."},{"s":3,"e":41,"t":"Episode 41","a":"1987-12-15","l":25,"d":"There are now two teams through to the semi-finals, but who will be the third?"},{"s":3,"e":42,"t":"Episode 42","a":"1987-12-16","l":25,"d":"One of tonight's teams will gain the last semi-final place. To get there they'll have to survive the challenge of the extra round, It's All Yours."},{"s":3,"e":43,"t":"Episode 43","a":"1987-12-17","l":25,"d":"After eight weeks of testing questions, four teams have made their way into the semi-finals, the first of which you can see tonight."},{"s":3,"e":44,"t":"Episode 44","a":"1987-12-18","l":25,"d":"As the climax of this year's competition draws nearer, one of tonight's teams will go through to Monday's final."},{"s":3,"e":45,"t":"Episode 45","a":"1987-12-21","l":25,"d":"After nine weeks of competition there are just two teams left. Tonight one of them will win the accolades, the trophy and the title of Masterteam 87"}]}